<title>FINLAND: TURKISTUOTTAJAT BUYS FIM 24 MLN PROPERTY.</title>
<headline>TURKISTUOTTAJAT BUYS FIM 24 MLN PROPERTY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish fur auction house Turkistuottajat Oy said in a statement on Friday it would buy a production facility from Elanto for 24 million markka.</p>
<p>&quot;Turkistuottajat will buy real-estate from co-operative (daily goods retailer) Elanto, where the company has had mink since 1995,&quot; Turkistuottajat said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
